            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper reports the Author's personal experience over the past 10 years and gives the most common indications for gynecology endoscopy. An increasingly wide range of possible uses for laparoscopy has been identified and the technique is now an essential element of day-to-day gynecological practice.</AbstractText>
